({{problem_id}})
*title {{title}}
*mode point-mass
*atmos standard
*earth {{earth_model}} omega={{earth_omega_rad_s}}
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
{{vehicle_runtime}}
{{control_lines}}
{{target_line}}
{{route_line}}
{{guidance_line}}
{{definition_line}}
*trajectory 1 {{trajectory_vehicle}} start on 1
  *initial geodetic {{initial_geodetic}}
  *segment 1 {{segment_name}}
    *integ dtprnt={{dtprnt}} dt={{dt}}
{{propulsion_line}}
{{aero_line}}
{{fly_line}}
{{file_line}}
    *when time>{{stop_time}} stop
*end
